{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "173", "x": 0.8957535496958443, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.037989698907791414, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Part 1", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15360198182160828, "w": 0.06881167324518032, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Man): Sandra, I seem to remember you had some family visitors staying", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.18386064948090083, "w": 0.8261688639302142, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "with you recently.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.20418138995485352, "w": 0.19093140127108388, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Sandra): Yeah, that's right. My brother and his family were here a", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.23443998217136106, "w": 0.8260378370392516, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "couple of months ago.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.25476072264531374, "w": 0.23532767949223082, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Man): Okay, good. Well, I wanted to ask your advice. I've got my cousin", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.28520475322740463, "w": 0.826187318421899, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "and her family visiting next month. month. And as I don't have kids, I'd have no idea", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.30552549370135734, "w": 0.826732033501464, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "where to take them.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3258462153146138, "w": 0.21275158213945589, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Sandra): Right. What about accommodation? Are they going to stay", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3561048075311213, "w": 0.8262884080263505, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "with you in your flat?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3765738685204267, "w": 0.22262863113910453, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Man): No. Thankfully, there wouldn't be room. My cousin wants me to", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4068324984583267, "w": 0.8261081691575617, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "recommend a hotel. Do you know anywhere?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4271532389322794, "w": 0.4619285118103108, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Sandra): Yes, I do. Actually, I always recommend people stay at the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4574118688701794, "w": 0.826147436214869, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "King's Hotel. Speaker 1 (Man): Where's that near?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.47775731685622674, "w": 0.510507449309356, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Sandra): It's about 5 minutes walk from Murray Station, so nice and", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5080159467941268, "w": 0.8262553949912254, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "central. It's actually on George Street.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5284850077834321, "w": 0.3980301419263188, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Man): Oh. Oh, yes, I know. I think they're on quite a tight budget. So,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5587435999999396, "w": 0.8261656856566462, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "how much roughly is it to stay there?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5790643404738923, "w": 0.384088029770786, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Sandra): If you book a family room, it's about £125 per night. My", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6093229704117924, "w": 0.8262247400300378, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "brother paid for two double rooms in the end, and I think that was around £95 for", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6297919936797053, "w": 0.826533955290713, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "each room.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6501128095964429, "w": 0.12179210953602025, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Man): Oh, that's not too bad.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6804084442203961, "w": 0.4115354465161662, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Sandra): So, how old are your cousin's kids?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7106671118796887, "w": 0.5748089985741854, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Man): 12 and nine. So, I want to organize some trips while they're here.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7409257040961962, "w": 0.8261607644588636, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "I was thinking of doing a bus tour of the city center as none of them have been", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7613947650855015, "w": 0.826248218244459, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "here before.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7817155055594542, "w": 0.13388644008036726, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Sandra): Those bus tours are quite expensive. I think it's better to do", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8119740977759617, "w": 0.8263734012130548, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "a walking tour. It gives you a much better feel for the city. There's one that starts", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8322948382499145, "w": 0.8259684276455257, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "from Colton Square. It takes a couple of hours and doesn't cost that much.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8527638992392199, "w": 0.7633294742940722, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Man): Sounds good. I'll look that up. Thanks.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8830472366892145, "w": 0.566544513310456, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}], "source": "pdf text layer"}